 bits of it along the way. As society has become progressively more degraded over the past 50 years the amounts stolen have increased and the number of people in on the grift has increased.\n\nAll presidents increased their wealth after leaving office. But mostly it was human amounts. \nNixon $2 to $10M\nFord $1M to $7M\nCarter $2M to $10M\nReagan $10M to $15M\nBush 1 $4 to $23M\n\nBut when the country really started going astray with financialization of our economy and the hollowing out our industrial base along with the Global War on Terror slush fund, the numbers got crazy\nClinton $1M to $120M ($250 if you count Hillary)\nBush 2 $20M to $40M\nObama $1M to $70M\n\nBiden was pretty modest $8M to $10M, but he was an invalid and Obama's sock puppet.\n\nhttps://www.newsweek.com/chart-shows-net-worth-us-presidents-before-after-office-1992975", "author": "SuperDuperBasedMD", "created": 1791884515756, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Darth0311", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Pure coincidence: Since 9/11 and the rise of China, politicians have started getting really, really rich.", "last_comment_created": 1791936067670, "content": "<p>Politicians don't create wealth. They find ways to tax you, then spend it to ensure their re-election and increase their power. Corrupt politicians find ways to steal little bits of it along the way. As society has become progressively more degraded over the past 50 years the amounts stolen have increased and the number of people in on the grift has increased.</p>\n<p>All presidents increased their wealth after leaving office. But mostly it was human amounts.\nNixon $2 to $10M\nFord $1M to $7M\nCarter $2M to $10M\nReagan $10M to $15M\nBush 1 $4 to $23M</p>\n<p>But when the country really started going astray with financialization of our economy and the hollowing out our industrial base along with the Global War on Terror slush fund, the numbers got crazy\nClinton $1M to $120M ($250 if you count Hillary)\nBush 2 $20M to $40M\nObama $1M to $70M</p>\n<p>Biden was pretty modest $8M to $10M, but he was an invalid and Obama's sock puppet.</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.newsweek.com/chart-shows-net-worth-us-presidents-before-after-office-1992975\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.newsweek.com/chart-shows-net-worth-us-presidents-before-after-office-1992975</a></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 42, "score_up": 724, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2110237496089206790", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVexVQSH", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 19, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8885219, "raw_content": "", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1791955531607, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "LLP2", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVexVQSH.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/Nerdrotics/status/2110237496089206790?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Some people will say this is fake.", "last_comment_created": 1791964665561, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image